window.products.push({"id":1159099,"name":"COSYCO Shag Shaggy Faux Fur Area Rug, Soft Plush Fluffy Fuzzy Rug for Boys Girls Kids Nursery, Large Square Rug for Bedroom, Living Room, Dorm, Patio,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QmqgGhabL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Material: Shaggy faux fur area rug, made of high-density synthetic microfiber, is plush and warm, soft and skin-friendly, perfect for your kids and pets when they play on the floor with bared feet. Non-slip rug also features a non-woven fabric backing to increase friction and durability for a safe and life-time service. There is no fading, no shedding and no smell problem with our shag rug. Modern Chic Design: Red area rug with white highlights, measuring 6x6 feet, is large enough for your family members or close friends to share the space. Fuzzy rug with a stylish and fashionable design is great to add softness, coziness and texture to your home decor and turn your room into an inviting and relaxing place. Soft rug is also edged with neat and tight stitching to ensure the durability. Versatile For Any Room: This soft and plush rug is both functional to keep you cozy and warm whether you sit or walk on the large area rug especially in cold seasons, and decorative to bring your room decor to the next level. Versatile shaggy area rugs for bedroom, living room, nursery room, kids room, play room, reading room, home office, college dorm, beside couch and fireplace, etc. Care Instructions & Gift Idea: For daily cleaning, vacuum on the lowest setting and spot cleaning with a damp cloth is highly recommended. For deep cleaning, only dryclean is recommended. No machine washing. No ironing. Our soft and fluffy area rug is also an ideal gift for your loved ones on any holiday and occasion, such as Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, New Year’s Day, house warming, etc. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed: COSYCO faux fur rug is rolled up for convenient package and transportation. Please unfold these rugs on the floor and wait the recovery patiently for 2-3 days. Your 100% satisfaction is our #1 priority. If you have any problem with our area rugs, please feel free to contact us for assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QmqgGhabL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSYCO","source_asin":"B0BP6GM1TZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6GM1TZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6GM1TZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1159100,"name":"Elite Zester and Parmesan Grater with Catcher - Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MGN7GPhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handheld Citrus Zester and Parmesan Grater_Need to measure your zest, or add the perfect amount of grated parmesan cheese to a recipe? This tool is for you, the cover doubles as a measuring cup, and has the perfect blade for grating both parmesan and zesting citrus!_The Microplane Elite Series includes a transparent cover that doubles as a grating catch feature and measuring cup with a generous 1-cup capacity. Use the stainless steel Microplane® fine blade to create flavorful citrus zest without any of bitter white pith just under the fruit’s peel. It's stellar at grating aromatics, such as shallots, onions, garlic, and ginger into a fine paste that melts and blends instantly with other ingredients in a pan, as well as transforming Parmesan and other hard cheese into powdery mounds for garnishing pasta and other savory dishes. Use a Zester Grater for: Zest citrus at the perfect depth to only get the zest, and not the bitter white pith. It is a multi-purpose tool it is recommended for grating garlic, grating ginger, grating parmesan cheese. You can also use as a nutmeg grater or gain the benefits of cinnamon by grating it on this tool. The made in USA blade has super sharp teeth to increase its efficiency. It does not rip or tear the food and prevents bruising. Product Details: Non-slip base for added stability Comfortable soft-grip handle with loop for optional hanging Dual Purpose Cover/Measuring Cup included Dimensions: 11.2\"L x 3.2\"W x 1.3\"D Material: 18/8 stainless steel blade and frame Blade made in the USA, Assembled in MX Shipping Weight: 7 oz_Top-rack dishwasher safe. Hand wash cover. We recommend rinsing your grater in warm water immediately after each use. Remove trapped particles from the non-sharp side whenever possible. To remove trapped particles on the front, first soak the tool in warm water and then use a cleaning brush to stroke in the Same direction as the teeth. Store with blade covered when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MGN7GPhXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microplane","source_asin":"B00LNBAGNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LNBAGNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LNBAGNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
