window.products.push({"id":1159173,"name":"LPONJAR Digital Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Food Thermometer for Grilling, BBQ, Cooking, Baking, Liquids- Foldable Probe, Bottle Opener, IP67 Water","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v1VqX7CGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Instant Read Meat Thermometer 】- LPONJAR Instant Read Meat Thermometer with a food grade stainless temperature probe, suitable for measure any type of food temp for indoor/outdoor cooking, grilling, BBQ and more; Thermometer takes the temperature in a little as 2-3 seconds and is accurate to ±1°C(1.8℉) degrees with a wide range of -50°C~300°C(-58℉~572℉). 【 Waterproof Design & Durable Material 】- Our Digital Meat Thermometer with IP67 rated waterproof, can be washed under running water without fear! ( NOTE: Don't immerse it in water for minutes or put it in a dishwasher. ) LPONJAR Digital Food Thermometer with a strong ABS plastic body, it can withstand accidental drops or other impact accidents. It doesn't melt easily at high temperatures, perfect for outdoor grilling. 【 Backlight Display & Multi Use 】- Our Cooking Thermometer with backlight can display the temperature of your food on a large LCD screen, enabling you to see the temp clearly whether in a poorly lighted kitchen or outdoors of too much light. Compared to other Meat Thermometers, LPONJAR Meat Thermometer is also a bottle opener, allowing you to easily open a beer while you eat barbecue and enjoy a good day. 【 Easy to Use & Easy Storage 】-Works right out the box! The Meat Thermometer is pre-calibrated, so you don't need to calibrate by yourself. With Auto On/Off function, you can unfold the probe to turn on or fold to turn off. The ℃/℉ button switches between Centigrade and Fahrenheit. This Food Thermometer with an internal magnet and large hang hole, you can stick it on the fridge or hang it on the hook, it can be easily stored wherever you want. 【 100% Satisfied 】- Our team provides all of our customers' high-quality products and professional after-sales service. If there is any problem with the product, please don't hesitate to contact us. We will give you 100 points of satisfaction. LPONJAR Digital Food Thermometer makes an essential for your kitchen, let you easily make delicious dishes. There are two color Digital Thermometers available(Red and Black).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v1VqX7CGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LPONJAR","source_asin":"B0B63KJBSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63KJBSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63KJBSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
