window.products.push({"id":1159339,"name":"Unicorn Alarm Clocks for girls,7-in-1 Night Light Kids Alarm Clocks with LED Glowing Bedroom Wake Up Alarm Clock Gifts for Unicorn Room Decor for Girl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61twELMs-2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🦄[THERE IS A UNICORN IN EVERY CHILD'S HEART]--Through market research and buyer feedback, we found that unicorns are deeply loved by children, so we specially designed the unicorn alarm clock with 7 kinds of LED lights and 8 kinds of wake-up ringtones and a USB date cable, through the LED display you can see the time, date and temperature. Digital alarm clock for kids with unicorn pattern creates a dreamy feeling, it is a perfect gift for kids who love unicorn. 🦄[DON'T MAKE KIDS HAVE TROUBLE GETTING UP]-Kids alarm clock has been specially designed with 8 different soft ringtones. Compared with other alarm clocks with unpleasant and sharp ring tones on the market, our alarm clock ringing is in line with children's aesthetics and can gently wake your baby up every day, let children have a good day. When the alarm clock rings, you can press the \"SET\" button on the alarm clock and stop the alarm at the same time, without scaring your sleeping kids. 🦄[A PERFECT GIFT FOR KIDS]--Bedroom alarm clock is powered by 2 * AG 13 batteries to show alarm and time, use of 4 * AAA batteries allows alarm clock to glow in order to act as a night light for kids can be active at night. USB cable is also included, you can choose to use it plug-in or battery-powered, which can be used in the living room, bedroom or other places. Digital alarm clock is best gift for all holidays such as birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Hanukkah, school begins & graduation. 🦄[EXERCISE KID'S AUTONOMY]-- Girl alarm clock is easy to operate, let your child set it! Press \"SET\" and then \"UP\" to set the time in the order of hour-minute-year-month-day-week. \"UP\" and \"DOWN\" are conversion keys for time and temperature respectively. Girls alarm clock has 7 color lights, the switch is moved to \"OFF\" and pressing the top of alarm clock will light up, move to \"ON/DEMO\" is always on, it can be used as a night light to provide illumination. 🦄[STRIVE TO BE THE BEST SELLER]--Kandice brand is a direct joint venture between the US and China with over 10 years of experience in children's toys, with R&D and testing centers in both the US and China to deliver outstanding application designs. We sincerely support 7 * 24h technical service, and we are more than happy to listen to your suggestions or needs for improvement, if you have any questions or suggestions please do not hesitate to contact us in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61twELMs-2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kandice","source_asin":"B08MW8686F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MW8686F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MW8686F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
