window.products.push({"id":1159537,"name":"Christmas Movie Watching Blanket - Vintage Truck and Tree - Throw Blanket for Couch - Holiday Gift -Sweater Fleece - 50\"x 60\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19Te1QB3BL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect sized throw blanket for cuddling up and watching your favorite Christmas movies. Blanket is a soft sweater fleece with a grey heathered design on the front. DETAILS: -Sweater fleece  -Grey Heather  -50\"x 60\"  -Design is permanently sublimated into the fibers of the blanket - no peeling!  -Design size is approximately 9\"x 12\"  -Design sublimated into one corner of the blanket  -Size and color of graphic may vary slightly from what you see on your screen -Machine wash cold, separately. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. *The process of sublimation dyes the original fabric, therefore slight imperfections and color variations will be seen through the design in the final product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A19Te1QB3BL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barn Owl Designs Shop","source_asin":"B0825FGJML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0825FGJML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0825FGJML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
