window.products.push({"id":1159554,"name":"4XL Bamboo Butcher Block Cutting Board - Extra Large Cutting Boards for Kitchen 36 x 24 - Wood Countertop 24 x 36 Cutting Board - Wooden Extra Large C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+BF4fM4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GORGEOUS, FUNCTIONAL, TWO-TONE BAMBOO 36 INCH CUTTING BOARD FOR PERFECT PRO MEAL PREP - If you’re looking for a responsibly-sourced, practical, beautifully designed cutting board, look no further! This chopping board is so durable that it stands up to preparing, carving & presenting the largest turkeys, prime rib, BBQ, cheese wheels, and giant watermelons! It measures 36 x 24 x 0.75 inches to make meal prepping easy & less cluttered; to satisfy every creation and craving. CREATE COUNTER SPACE TO DECLUTTER YOUR KITCHEN - Weighing just 17 lbs, this extra large chopping block is shockingly lightweight for its massive size and it’s just what you need to declutter your kitchen! It can even be placed on your stovetop or gas range as a noodle board to free up countertop space and doubles as a large charcuterie board with hand grips! Its 4-ounce collection corner also collects more run-off juices for sauces & marinades. It’s the last large cutting board you’ll ever need. IMPRESS GUESTS & MEAL PREP LIKE A PRO WITH THIS OVER THE SINK COVER 24 x 36 BUTCHER BLOCK - This extra large cutting board is not only impressive in its appearance – you can use it to carve, slice, filet, or chop your cooked or raw meats, fruit, veggies & cheese. Use it for multiple meal preps at once or for one big family meal. It fits over most sinks so you can save on countertop space, and it wipes down easily. This large cutting board will quickly become your daily go-to food prep companion. ENJOY COOKING WITH A SAFER, SMARTER DESIGN - Bamboo's natural properties make these butcher block cutting boards a must-have kitchen companion. They’re great for chopping veggies and slicing raw and cooked foods. Easy to care for and clean, this wood cutting board preserves your knife edge longer and has hand grooves for moving safely from kitchen to table. The deep juice grooves even capture juices that you can transform into homemade glazes & gravies. Perfect for health-conscious families! 1-YEAR REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE - Unlike glass cutting boards or plastic cutting boards, we responsibly & ethically source our bamboo to last. In fact, we guarantee this product for a full year. This Bamboo Cutting Board is a memorable housewarming gift or wedding gift and is well received by friends and family at Christmas, Mother’s Day, or even birthdays. For long-lasting beauty and durability, hand wash and oil it frequently with our 100% Pure Walnut Cutting Board Oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+BF4fM4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greener Chef","source_asin":"B0BPMW5GTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPMW5GTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPMW5GTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
