window.products.push({"id":1159760,"name":"The B-Style Large Wall Clock Moving Gear Wall Clocks for Living Room Decor 24 inch Rustic Farmhouse Wall Clock Vintage Industrial Decorative Wood Cloc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P9LJBOYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REAL WORKING GEARS: Large wall clocks with unique moving parts is as attractive as it is functional. Put batteries in, various gears start rotating fluently. Moving gear wall clock is amazing looking on the wall and will get so many compliments on it. Made from wood and painted by Fake Rust color on wall clock create a very rustic and industrial atmosphere. Farmhouse wall clock is professionally handmade and pursuit of naturalness, so it may have some little imperfections. ACCURATE TIME& BATTERY OPERATED: Quality quartz sweeping mechanism for accurate time without any ticking sounds. Power by 3 AA Carbon battery operated (not included), oversized wall clock takes 2 sets of batteries, one set for the clock and the other for gears that spin. Both of them can be used individually. EASY TO READ&INSTALL: 24 inches (60cm) in diameter and 4.4 lbs (2kg) in weight, big size yet lightweight enough. Large Roman numerals in 3D hollowed-out design make you read the time easily. Decorative wall clock is lightweight, so it's easy to carry and place on the wall. Also with a hanging hole on the back, this vintage industrial wall clock is easy to hang up, hanger included. WIDE APPLICATIONS: Gear wall clock is not only a timepiece, but also a piece of artwork, greatly adding charm to a room, like living room, farmhouse, fireplace, bedroom or dining room, studio, gallery, loft, cafe, bar, club, etc. This clock will becomes an instant conversational piece for the moving gears and how cool it looks. Also awesome gifts for families or friends. GURANTEE&WARRANTY: Refund or replacement is FULLY GUARANTEED if clocks damaged, just simply sending some photos by email. Sometimes clock hands may be loose or does not work because of some collision on the transportation, but dont worry, they can be fixed, please contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P9LJBOYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The B-Style TB","source_asin":"B09ZDT161X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZDT161X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZDT161X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
