window.products.push({"id":1159764,"name":"RUNTOP Portable Battery Operated Fan with LED Lantern, 7 inch Foldable Personal Desk Fan, Outdoor Small Rechargeable Quiet Camping Fan, Cooling Table ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YEvkQ5UwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Foldable Design & Angle Adjustment】 The camping fan is foldable and easy to carry. The desktop fan can also adjust its angle to blow cool air from various angles, suitable for camping, fishing, barbecue, home, bedroom, and office. And dealing with heat, hurricanes, and power outages 【 USB Charging & Battery Indicator Light 】 The portable desk fan equipped with a large capacity rechargeable battery, you can use it in extremely hot and humid weather without the need for AC power. The packaging includes a C-type fast charging cable and is equipped with 4 indicator lights to remind you to charge in a timely manner. A fully charged battery can last for 8-25 hours, bringing you more long-lasting cooling. No longer worry about power outages or outdoor unavailability! 【 Lightweight & Durable 】 Small Table Fan - The compact size does not take up too much space and is easy to fit into the backpack. It is made of high-quality ABS+PC material, and the wide and sturdy base can prevent tipping. No matter where you are, it can always meet your needs. The perfect companion for fishing, camping, travel, beaches, popular sports events, and hiking! Summer is approaching, so it will be well utilized! 【 Bright LED Lamp 】 The camping fan design features 3 brightness settings of LED lights, designed to meet your outdoor lighting requirements. Provide soft and non dazzling light to protect your vision and enhance your night use ability. If you enjoy outdoor travel or camping, it is an ideal place to read or study at night. 【Adjustable & Hanging Hook 】 The camping fan has a 270 ° rotation adjustment function, providing cool breeze in the desired direction. The bottom is equipped with hooks because you can hinge the fan together and place it anywhere, such as the top of the tent, umbrella, hammock, and RV. Enjoy the homemade breeze!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YEvkQ5UwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUNTOP","source_asin":"B0C39RXJ1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C39RXJ1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C39RXJ1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
