window.products.push({"id":1159923,"name":"Tag Azure 12-1/2-Inch Hand-Painted Earthenware Chip And Dip Server, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+kDRpQqAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The large round chip and dip server has a center section with a 3/4-cup capacity and three outer sections, each with a 1-cup capacity. Handpainted, the dish has a base color of deep, luxurious turquoise with a rich blue trim and accented by bright tangerine-orange, blues, greens, and white. The dish coordinates with most any tableware patterns. The dish is ideal for serving chips and dip, crudites, or any number of elegant or casual food options. It has a glazed finish with embossed dot and floral detailing. The dish is microwavable and dishwasher safe and measures 12-1/2 inches across. It makes a great gift idea for any occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+kDRpQqAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAG","source_asin":"B003AIKMWU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003AIKMWU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003AIKMWU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1159924,"name":"Krups 287-42 4-Slice Sensotoast Deluxe Toaster, Black, DISCONTINUED","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z1XZSW1BL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description KRUPS ''Sensotoast Deluxe'' two-slot, four-slice toaster is the ideal model for a breakfast the whole family can enjoy. It has long and wide slots that easily accommodate a wide assortment of breads and baked goods, such as bagels, thickly sliced breads and waffles. The quartz heating element, six different toast settings Amazon.com Prying a burned bagel from the death-defying grip of a toaster is not a fun way to start your morning--but it happens to everyone sooner or later. With the huge slots on this fancy machine, the chance of that happening is slim indeed. Each of the four slots measures 1-3/4 inches wide by 10 inches long--you won't even have to slice crumpets to have them fit snugly inside. There are seven different temperature settings, including a defroster that improves texture immensely for those frozen waffles and pastries. Two great safety features are the cool-touch sides and the extra-high lift on the bread--toast pops up nearly an inch higher than most toasters, so your fingers stay well away from the heating elements. For cleaning, a crumb removal tray shuts securely enough that you won't have crumbs leaking onto your countertop. --Jill Lightner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Z1XZSW1BL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUPS","source_asin":"B00004SPE5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SPE5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SPE5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1159925,"name":"Viking Culinary 3-Ply 13-Piece Cookware Set,Stainless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBwAN-XUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring professional quality and functionality to your kitchen. The Viking 3-Ply 13-Piece Cookware Set includes the essential pots and pans needed in most kitchens. With this contemporary cookware, you can experience gourmet cooking at an affordable price. Featuring three layers of stainless steel and aluminum, these cookware sets offer efficient frying, sauteing, steaming and more for all of your favorite meats, veggies and sides. Each pan offers an aluminum-alloy core bonded to stainless steel. The outer layer of surgical-grade 304 stainless steel increases efficiency and gives each pot and pan a mirror finish. The interior aluminum provides heating that reduces hot spots during cooking. The set includes tempered-glass, vented lids that let you monitor your dishes without losing heat. Outfit your kitchen with the Viking 3-Ply 13-Piece Cookware Set. With a combination of stainless steel and aluminum, these pans provide superior heating and durability for a night in or hosting special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBwAN-XUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Culinary","source_asin":"B09S4YF2ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S4YF2ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S4YF2ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1159926,"name":"MollyMac CORFE Castle Tea Towel Pretty Kitchen Home Decor | Cute Dish Cloth with Hanging Loop | Made in UK | Dorset Souvenir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1k4uASVnWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Built by William the Conqueror, who apparently loved a flowery fabric. This beautifully designed tea towel would be perfect for a holiday home, a camper van or just to cheer you up on a cold wet day in January. TEA TOWELS ARE OFTEN MISTAKEN AS A MODEST AND UNASSUMING ADDITION TO A KITCHEN, when in fact they are a statement of design and personality and don't let anyone tell you any different. Although these tea towels will dry your dishes to perfection we cannot say they will make the job any more enjoyable, they are not magic. THIS ORIGINAL DESIGN BY MOLLYMAC was created to add some colour and joy to your home. MollyMac are a design duo based in Jersey, Channel Islands who spend their time coming up with new and distinctive things to give your home a unique feel. These also make wonderful gifts if you can bear to part with them, maybe you should get two? PRINTED AND DESIGNED IN THE UK MollyMac work closely with their suppliers to ensure the quality and finish of the products is perfect. Every process is undertaken with care and precision, we know your dishes deserve the best. FANTASTIC QUALITY machine wash at 40º. If you feel they are too lovely to use, drape these tea towels casually around your kitchen or hang them from the very convenient loop, for friends and family to admire. FREE DELIVERY SO ADD TO YOU BASKET NOW! Our items are all sent by standard post and so we are unable to offer a tracking service; however rest assured if there are any problems we will resolve them as quickly as we can, just get in touch with us. We are posting to you from Jersey so please be patient as things can take a little longer to arrive, sometimes we get fogged in for days and don't get me started on what happens if it snows!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1k4uASVnWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MollyMac","source_asin":"B093QKHW93","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1159926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093QKHW93","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093QKHW93","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
